  "changes": [
    {
      "id": "weekly-upstream-20261101",
      "notes": "Async API key suppliers resolve before each authenticated Chat/Completion/Embedding/Image request and trusted image download, retaining explicit auth overrides and foreign-origin stripping. Add native mapReasoning callback for portable reasoning only; explicit provider reasoningEffort bypasses the callback. Misplaced completion system errors include their content. Reviewed upstream: @ai-sdk/openai-compatible 3.0.78 to 3.0.82. Validation passed: node Scripts/test-packages.mjs (all 52 owning package suites and the compatibility facade); node Scripts/sdk.mjs generate --check; node --test Scripts/tests/*.test.cjs (27 passed); docs-site check and build (100 pages). Live provider calls were not run.",
      "compatibility": "Minor release for additive native API; existing static settings and call sites remain compatible. Updated direct dependency minimums are recorded in the manifest. Existing documented JS/framework and native product gaps remain; version-delta review does not imply full parity or live-service testing. Explicit custom authentication skips an unused credential supplier, a deliberate native callback-order adaptation."
    }
  ],
